ille, com 2 quartos e suíte, perto de parques, comércio, escolas e das principais vias da região, esta é uma oportunidade pronta para morar. Agende sua visita.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aecff57b88b84f331383651/pilar-homes-images-watermark/6ed61f5d-2d00-4443-8578-08eef81c9995.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aecff57b88b84f331383651/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5738f684-152f-4d82-86ff-30139aff5d59.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aecff57b88b84f331383651/pilar-homes-images-watermark/673ccc3a-8382-46aa-80ee-3db67a474ee8.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aecff57b88b84f331383651/pilar-homes-images-watermark/e1ef0c31-65d0-4555-95fa-fe707b537a61.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aecff57b88b84f331383651/pilar-homes-images-watermark/8d41e93a-92ee-4981-abcc-42c4aa8a346c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aecff57b88b84f331383651/pilar-homes-images-watermark/705c288d-3f87-4c84-8b9e-0861ab931120.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aecff57b88b84f331383651/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c9d47edf-1d06-4e7a-b821-66c479d83bbc.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aecff57b88b84f331383651/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5f88da31-74ff-41c6-bddf-d31e7e50cc7d.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aecff57b88b84f331383651/pilar-homes-images-watermark/1672ba8f-f357-4729-b1f0-da0826fe99ab.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aecff57b88b84f331383651/pilar-homes-images-watermark/7c23c0d5-84ca-4a72-bb39-78e88514bc00.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aecff57b88b84f331383651/pilar-homes-images-watermark/414107f8-0428-4141-9c31-040e829c6da3.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aecff57b88b84f331383651/pilar-homes-images-watermark/e86d4c33-75b0-4531-b0a8-cdfff2264516.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amaz